### Text Edit Distance - Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Discovery - List all text algorithms
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/text/algorithms

### Levenshtein (RapidFuzz default)
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/text/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "algorithm": "levenshtein",
  "params": {},
  "inputs": [
    { "id": "p1", "a": "kitten", "b": "sitting" },
    { "id": "p2", "a": "flaw", "b": "lawn" }
  ]
}

### Levenshtein (textdistance)
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/text/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "algorithm": "levenshtein",
  "params": {},
  "inputs": [
    { "id": "p1", "a": "kitten", "b": "sitting" }
  ]
}

